        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saddle up and get ready for a paw-some adventure in Cats Visiting Wild West! Explore charming hand-drawn scenes filled with saloons, dusty towns, steam trains, and desert canyons — all packed with mischievous hidden cats waiting to be found.<br><br>Search every corner of these nostalgic Wild West illustrations and test your observation skills. From sneaky cats hiding in barrels to ones peeking out of cowboy hats, can you find them all?<br><br>Each scene also hides a special collectible object — gather them all to complete your Wild West collection!<br><br>Features:<br>5 beautifully illustrated Wild West scenes<br>80 hidden cats to find in each level<br>A collectible item hidden in every scene<br>Relaxing gameplay perfect for casual players<br>Timer and leaderboard for competitive cat hunters<br><br>Grab your hat, partner — those kitties won’t find themselves!</p>",
